{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43481","headline":"长安早春 · 无名氏","name":"长安早春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杳霭三春色，先从帝里芳。\n折杨犹恨短，测景已忻长。\n莺和红楼乐，花连紫禁香。\n跃鱼惊太液，佳气接温汤。\n风送飞珂响，尘蒙翠辇光。\n熙熙晴煦远，徒欲奉尧觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}